---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="NodeMaven 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/nodemaven.png`} alt="NodeMaven" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">NodeMaven 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">住宅+移动双池，95% IP 纯净率</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">IP 纯净度</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">响应速度</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">覆盖范围</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          NodeMaven 是一家提供住宅和移动双代理池的新兴服务商。3000 万+ 住宅 IP 和 295K 移动 IP 覆盖全球，95% IP 纯净率保证低封禁率。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          支持国家、城市、ZIP 码和 ISP 级精确定位。99.54% 成功率和低于 0.6s 平均速度，提供实时 IP 质量过滤功能。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          支持旋转和粘性会话（最长 7 天），流量可结转。支持加密货币支付。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">95% IP 纯净率</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">实时 IP 质量过滤器自动排除低质量和已被标记的 IP，保证 IP 的高纯净度。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">住宅+移动双池</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">3000 万+ 住宅 IP + 295K 移动 IP 在一个统一网络中。无需管理多个供应商即可同时使用两种代理类型。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">精准定位</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持国家、城市、ZIP 码和 ISP 级精确定位。适合需要高精度地理定位的采集和验证任务。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">长粘性会话</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">粘性会话最长可保持 7 天同一 IP，适合需要保持登录状态的账号管理场景。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">流量结转</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">未使用的流量可结转到下一周期，避免浪费。支持按量计费模式。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">试用方案</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">$3.50 试用方案提供 750MB 带宽，让用户在购买前评估服务质量。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 数据采集</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">IP 质量过滤器和双代理池保证高成功率。精准定位满足各类采集需求。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 账号管理</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">长粘性会话（最长 7 天）适合社交账号和电商店铺管理。纯净 IP 降低封禁风险。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. 广告验证</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">城市和 ZIP 码级定位可精确查看不同地区的广告投放效果。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">4. AI Agent 集成</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">NodeMaven 针对 AI Agent 和自动化工作流进行了优化。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>95% IP 纯净率</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>住宅+移动双代理池</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>ZIP 码级精准定位</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>最长 7 天粘性会话</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>$3.50 低价试用</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L3.34 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌较新知名度有限</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无中文界面</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>移动 IP 池规模较小</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          NodeMaven 以住宅+移动双代理池和 95% IP 纯净率为特色，为数据采集和账号管理提供了高质量的代理资源。ZIP 码级定位和长粘性会话在同类产品中具有竞争力。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，NodeMaven 获得 7.0 分，适合需要高纯净 IP 和精准定位的代理用户。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://nodemaven.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 NodeMaven 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
